---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms"
  description="Terms of use for Quote Forensics, including the educational-information disclaimer."
>
  <section class="container prose">
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p>Last updated: October 1, 2026.</p>

    <h2>Educational information only</h2>
    <p>
      Everything on this site is general educational information about contractor
      pricing, project process, and consumer rights in the United States. It is
      not an inspection, appraisal, structural or engineering opinion, or legal
      advice, and it does not create a professional relationship of any kind.
      We are not licensed contractors, engineers, or attorneys in the United
      States.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to get real advice</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Safety, code, structural, electrical, gas:</strong> your local building authority or a licensed professional.</li>
      <li><strong>Legal disputes, liens, contracts:</strong> a licensed attorney in your state.</li>
      <li><strong>Licensing status:</strong> your state contractor licensing board — we link to it, we do not certify anyone.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Prices change</h2>
    <p>
      Cost ranges are dated and sourced. Markets move, materials move, and rules
      change. Use each figure as a sanity check with its date attached — never
      as a guaranteed price.
    </p>

    <h2>No guarantees</h2>
    <p>
      We do not guarantee any outcome: not a price, not a negotiation result,
      not a permitting decision, and not the behavior of any contractor. The
      verdict tool is a rules-based comparison against published ranges, not a
      prediction.
    </p>

    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>
      The site is provided as-is. To the maximum extent permitted by law, we are
      not liable for decisions you make or money you spend based on this
      content. Verify everything that matters — licenses, insurance, permits,
      written scope — with the primary source.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p><a href="mailto:hello@quoteforensics.com">hello@quoteforensics.com</a></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
